# Generated results.
#
# Tables and figures are regenerated by `make all`, so only .gitkeep is tracked.
# results/logs/verification.md IS tracked. Executed notebook copies (with
# outputs) are never tracked -- the committed notebooks stay output-stripped.
results/tables/*.csv
results/figures/*.png
results/figures/*.pdf
results/logs/executed/
!results/**/.gitkeep
